{
    "name": "AI Proposal Writer",
    "nodes": [
        {
            "parameters": {
                "httpMethod": "POST",
                "path": "generate-proposal",
                "options": {}
            },
            "id": "webhook-trigger",
            "name": "Webhook: Generate Proposal",
            "type": "n8n-nodes-base.webhook",
            "typeVersion": 2,
            "position": [
                200,
                300
            ],
            "webhookId": "proposal-writer"
        },
        {
            "parameters": {
                "jsCode": "// Validate and format the incoming request\nconst body = $input.first().json.body || $input.first().json;\n\nconst jobTitle = body.job_title || body.title || 'Unknown Job';\nconst jobDescription = body.job_description || body.description || '';\nconst jobBudget = body.budget || 'Not specified';\nconst jobLink = body.link || body.url || '';\n\nif (!jobDescription || jobDescription.length < 20) {\n  return [{\n    json: {\n      error: true,\n      message: 'Job description is too short or missing. Send {job_title, job_description, budget, link}'\n    }\n  }];\n}\n\nreturn [{\n  json: {\n    job_title: jobTitle,\n    job_description: jobDescription.substring(0, 2000),\n    job_budget: jobBudget,\n    job_link: jobLink,\n    timestamp: new Date().toLocaleString('en-IN', { timeZone: 'Asia/Kolkata' })\n  }\n}];"
            },
            "id": "validate-input",
            "name": "Validate Input",
            "type": "n8n-nodes-base.code",
            "typeVersion": 2,
            "position": [
                420,
                300
            ]
        },
        {
            "parameters": {
                "conditions": {
                    "options": {
                        "caseSensitive": false,
                        "leftValue": "",
                        "typeValidation": "loose"
                    },
                    "combinator": "and",
                    "conditions": [
                        {
                            "id": "check-no-error",
                            "leftValue": "={{ $json.error }}",
                            "rightValue": true,
                            "operator": {
                                "type": "boolean",
                                "operation": "notEquals"
                            }
                        }
                    ]
                }
            },
            "id": "check-valid",
            "name": "Valid Input?",
            "type": "n8n-nodes-base.filter",
            "typeVersion": 2,
            "position": [
                620,
                300
            ]
        },
        {
            "parameters": {
                "modelId": {
                    "__rl": true,
                    "value": "gemini-2.0-flash",
                    "mode": "list"
                },
                "messages": {
                    "values": [
                        {
                            "content": "Write an Upwork proposal for developer Ayush Rai.\n\nHis background:\n- B.E. ECE, Meta-Certified Front-End Developer, 3+ years, based in Bengaluru, India\n- Ships production AI systems, not demos. 17+ projects completed.\n- Rate: $40/hr or equivalent fixed price\n\nHis relevant projects (reference 2-3 max that MATCH the job):\n1. TenderPilot AI: AI RFP/tender auto-filler with Chrome extension (React + Node + SQLite + hybrid vector search). Parses documents, auto-drafts answers, fills portal fields. Free/Pro/Team tiers.\n2. D2C Voice Agent: Enterprise WhatsApp voice AI for Indian D2C brands (FastAPI + LangGraph + Groq Whisper + Twilio). Transcribes Hindi/English voice notes, classifies 10 intent types, resolves 80% of tickets autonomously.\n3. Invosmith: AI invoice & proposal generator (Next.js + Gemini/Groq + Resend). Paste Hinglish notes → GST-compliant PDF in 60 seconds. 5 niche templates.\n4. SastaBot: Multilingual WhatsApp price comparison agent (FastAPI + LangGraph + Redis + Twilio). Compares prices across Amazon, Flipkart, Blinkit, Zepto, Instamart.\n5. ONDC Super Seller: B2B seller dashboard (Next.js + FastAPI + Supabase + Twilio WhatsApp). Bulk catalog import, real-time analytics, 140+ tests, CI/CD.\n6. Private Second Brain: Local RAG system (LangChain + ChromaDB + Ollama). Auto-embeds markdown vault, semantic search.\n7. AI Email Pipeline: n8n + Gemini + Gmail auto-classification & reply system.\n\nRules:\n- First line MUST hook — NOT 'Dear hiring manager' or 'I am writing to...'\n- Reference 2-3 specific projects that match THEIR job requirements\n- Mirror specific tech keywords from THEIR job post\n- End with EITHER: a paid trial task offer OR one smart clarifying question\n- Max 200 words total\n- Sign off as 'Ayush Rai'\n- Tone: confident, direct, no fluff\n\nReturn ONLY valid JSON:\n{\"proposal\": \"the full proposal text\", \"matching_projects\": [\"project names\"], \"confidence\": 0-100, \"suggested_rate\": \"$X/hr or $X fixed\"}"
                        },
                        {
                            "content": "=Job Title: {{ $json.job_title }}\n\nJob Description:\n{{ $json.job_description }}\n\nBudget: {{ $json.job_budget }}"
                        }
                    ]
                },
                "options": {
                    "temperature": 0.7,
                    "maxOutputTokens": 1024
                }
            },
            "id": "ai-write-proposal",
            "name": "AI: Write Proposal",
            "type": "@n8n/n8n-nodes-langchain.lmChatGoogleGemini",
            "typeVersion": 1,
            "position": [
                840,
                300
            ],
            "credentials": {
                "googleGeminiApi": {
                    "id": "REPLACE_WITH_YOUR_GEMINI_CREDENTIAL_ID",
                    "name": "Google Gemini"
                }
            }
        },
        {
            "parameters": {
                "jsCode": "// Parse the AI proposal response\nconst aiResponse = $input.first().json;\nconst originalJob = $('Validate Input').first().json;\nlet parsed;\n\ntry {\n  const rawText = aiResponse.text || aiResponse.output || JSON.stringify(aiResponse);\n  const cleaned = rawText.replace(/```json\\n?/g, '').replace(/```\\n?/g, '').trim();\n  parsed = JSON.parse(cleaned);\n} catch (e) {\n  parsed = {\n    proposal: 'Error generating proposal. Please try again.',\n    matching_projects: [],\n    confidence: 0,\n    suggested_rate: 'N/A'\n  };\n}\n\nreturn [{\n  json: {\n    ...originalJob,\n    ...parsed,\n    date: new Date().toISOString().split('T')[0]\n  }\n}];"
            },
            "id": "parse-proposal",
            "name": "Parse Proposal",
            "type": "n8n-nodes-base.code",
            "typeVersion": 2,
            "position": [
                1060,
                300
            ]
        },
        {
            "parameters": {
                "method": "POST",
                "url": "=https://api.telegram.org/botREPLACE_WITH_YOUR_TELEGRAM_BOT_TOKEN/sendMessage",
                "sendBody": true,
                "bodyParameters": {
                    "parameters": [
                        {
                            "name": "chat_id",
                            "value": "REPLACE_WITH_YOUR_TELEGRAM_CHAT_ID"
                        },
                        {
                            "name": "text",
                            "value": "=✍️ PROPOSAL GENERATED ({{ $json.confidence }}% confidence)\n\n📋 {{ $json.job_title }}\n💰 Suggested: {{ $json.suggested_rate }}\n🔗 {{ $json.matching_projects.join(', ') }}\n\n---\n\n{{ $json.proposal }}\n\n---\n🔗 {{ $json.job_link }}"
                        },
                        {
                            "name": "parse_mode",
                            "value": "HTML"
                        }
                    ]
                },
                "options": {}
            },
            "id": "telegram-proposal",
            "name": "Telegram: Send Proposal",
            "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
            "typeVersion": 4.2,
            "position": [
                1280,
                200
            ]
        },
        {
            "parameters": {
                "operation": "append",
                "documentId": {
                    "__rl": true,
                    "value": "REPLACE_WITH_PROPOSALS_SHEET_ID",
                    "mode": "id"
